    {
      "source": "Entity callback method invoked before an aggregate root is saved. Can return either the same or a modified instance\nof the aggregate and can modify <a href=\"../../../relational/core/conversion/MutableAggregateChange.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.conversion\"><code>MutableAggregateChange</code></a> contents. This method is called after converting the\n<code>aggregate</code> to <a href=\"../../../relational/core/conversion/MutableAggregateChange.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.conversion\"><code>MutableAggregateChange</code></a>. Changes to the aggregate are not taken into account to decide\nwhether the change will be an insert or update. Use the <a href=\"../../../relational/core/mapping/event/BeforeConvertCallback.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.mapping.event\"><code>BeforeConvertCallback</code></a> to change the persistent the\nentity before being converted.",
      "translation": "在保存聚合根之前调用实体回调方法。可以返回相同的或修改后的聚合实例，并可以修改 <a href=\"../../../relational/core/conversion/MutableAggregateChange.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.conversion\"><code>MutableAggregateChange</code></a> 的内容。此方法在将 <code>aggregate</code> 转换为 <a href=\"../../../relational/core/conversion/MutableAggregateChange.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.conversion\"><code>MutableAggregateChange</code></a> 之后被调用。对聚合的修改不会用于决定该变更是插入还是更新。请使用 <a href=\"../../../relational/core/mapping/event/BeforeConvertCallback.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.mapping.event\"><code>BeforeConvertCallback</code></a> 在转换之前更改持久化实体。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
